    "content": "<!-- AUTO-GENERATED by scripts/generate-skills.mjs. Do not edit by hand. -->\n<!-- OpenAPI version: 3.0; spec hash: sha256:02ab32e7dd082f88 -->\n\n# Refunds\n\nOpenAPI version: `3.0`  \nSpec hash: `sha256:02ab32e7dd082f88`\n\n## When To Use\n\nReturn funds for captured or successful orders.\n\n## Best Practice\n\nUse stable refund references, never exceed captured amount, and retry with the same idempotency key.\n\n## Operations\n\n| Operation | Method | Path | Safety | API reference |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `CreateRefund` | POST | `/api/pay/v1/refunds/{order_id}` | `live-money-movement` | [/api/refunds/create-refund](/api/refunds/create-refund) |\n\n## Shared Setup\n\nSet credentials server-side only:\n\n```bash\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret\nexport PINELABS_ENV=uat\n```\n\n### TypeScript SDK Client\n\n```ts\nimport { PinelabsApiClient } from \"pinelabs-node\";\n\nconst baseUrl = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\";\nconst auth = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: \"\" });\nconst tokenResponse = await auth.authentication.generateToken({\n  grant_type: \"client_credentials\",\n  client_id: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  client_secret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst client = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: tokenResponse.access_token });\n```\n\n### Python SDK Client\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom pinelabs import PinelabsApi\n\nbase_url = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\"\nauth = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=\"\")\ntoken_response = auth.authentication.generate_token(\n    grant_type=\"client_credentials\",\n    client_id=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_ID\"],\n    client_secret=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET\"],\n)\nclient = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=token_response.access_token)\n```\n\n### Agent Toolkit Setup\n\n```ts\nimport { Agent, run } from \"@openai/agents\";\nimport { PinelabsAgentToolkit, pinelabsEnvironment } from \"pinelabs-agent-toolkit/openai\";\n\nconst toolkit = new PinelabsAgentToolkit({\n  environment: pinelabsEnvironment.UAT,\n  clientId: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  clientSecret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst agent = new Agent({\n  name: \"Pine Labs Integration Agent\",\n  instructions: \"Use Pine Labs APIs in UAT unless production is explicitly confirmed.\",\n  tools: await toolkit.getAgentTools(),\n});\n```\n\n## Operation Examples\n\n### Create Refund (`CreateRefund`)\n\nCreates a refund against a completed order.\n\nSafety: `live-money-movement` - Money-moving operation. Default to UAT, require explicit production confirmation, use idempotency/request IDs, and emit audit output.\n\n#### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X POST \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in/api/pay/v1/refunds/<order_id>\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $PINELABS_ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Request-Timestamp: <Request-Timestamp>\" \\\n  -H \"Request-ID: <Request-ID>\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: <unique-request-id>\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"merchant_order_reference\":\"e436fefa-f0e9-4b36-ac01-3d158c31726c\",\"order_amount\":{\"value\":400,\"currency\":\"INR\"},\"merchant_metadata\":{\"clientId\":\"DD\",\"transactionReferenceNo\":\"pine-1223\",\"merchantId\":\"1234\",\"tid\":\"9000990\",\"acquirerName\":\"HDFC_FSS\",\"isOfferDisplayRequired\":\"true\",\"OfferData\":\"your_offer_data\",\"tenant_id\":\"PGATPOS\",\"is_offer_validation_required\":\"true\"}}'\n```\n\n#### CLI\n\n```bash\npinelabs create-refund \\\n  --env uat \\\n  --order_id <order_id> \\\n  --idempotency-key <unique-request-id> \\\n  --json '{\"merchant_order_reference\":\"e436fefa-f0e9-4b36-ac01-3d158c31726c\",\"order_amount\":{\"value\":400,\"currency\":\"INR\"},\"merchant_metadata\":{\"clientId\":\"DD\",\"transactionReferenceNo\":\"pine-1223\",\"merchantId\":\"1234\",\"tid\":\"9000990\",\"acquirerName\":\"HDFC_FSS\",\"isOfferDisplayRequired\":\"true\",\"OfferData\":\"your_offer_data\",\"tenant_id\":\"PGATPOS\",\"is_offer_validation_required\":\"true\"}}'\n```\n\n#### TypeScript SDK\n\n```ts\nconst result = await client.refunds.createRefund({\n  \"order_id\": \"v1-241010055924-aa-AHbN0s\",\n  \"merchant_order_reference\": \"e436fefa-f0e9-4b36-ac01-3d158c31726c\",\n  \"order_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 400,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  },\n  \"merchant_metadata\": {\n    \"clientId\": \"DD\",\n    \"transactionReferenceNo\": \"pine-1223\",\n    \"merchantId\": \"1234\",\n    \"tid\": \"9000990\",\n    \"acquirerName\": \"HDFC_FSS\",\n    \"isOfferDisplayRequired\": \"true\",\n    \"OfferData\": \"your_offer_data\",\n    \"tenant_id\": \"PGATPOS\",\n    \"is_offer_validation_required\": \"true\"\n  }\n});\nconsole.log(result);\n```\n\n#### Python SDK\n\n```python\nrequest = {\n  \"order_id\": \"v1-241010055924-aa-AHbN0s\",\n  \"merchant_order_reference\": \"e436fefa-f0e9-4b36-ac01-3d158c31726c\",\n  \"order_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 400,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  },\n  \"merchant_metadata\": {\n    \"clientId\": \"DD\",\n    \"transactionReferenceNo\": \"pine-1223\",\n    \"merchantId\": \"1234\",\n    \"tid\": \"9000990\",\n    \"acquirerName\": \"HDFC_FSS\",\n    \"isOfferDisplayRequired\": \"true\",\n    \"OfferData\": \"your_offer_data\",\n    \"tenant_id\": \"PGATPOS\",\n    \"is_offer_validation_required\": \"true\"\n  }\n}\nresult = client.refunds.create_refund(**request)\nprint(result)\n```\n\n#### Agent Toolkit Prompt\n\n```ts\nconst result = await run(agent, \"Use the Pine Labs CreateRefund operation in UAT. Do not run in production unless I explicitly confirm it. Input JSON: {\\\"order_id\\\":\\\"v1-241010055924-aa-AHbN0s\\\",\\\"merchant_order_reference\\\":\\\"e436fefa-f0e9-4b36-ac01-3d158c31726c\\\",\\\"order_amount\\\":{\\\"value\\\":400,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"INR\\\"},\\\"merchant_metadata\\\":{\\\"clientId\\\":\\\"DD\\\",\\\"transactionReferenceNo\\\":\\\"pine-1223\\\",\\\"merchantId\\\":\\\"1234\\\",\\\"tid\\\":\\\"9000990\\\",\\\"acquirerName\\\":\\\"HDFC_FSS\\\",\\\"isOfferDisplayRequired\\\":\\\"true\\\",\\\"OfferData\\\":\\\"your_offer_data\\\",\\\"tenant_id\\\":\\\"PGATPOS\\\",\\\"is_offer_validation_required\\\":\\\"true\\\"}}\");\nconsole.log(result.finalOutput);\n```\n\n## Public URL\n\nThis reference is also generated at `/.well-known/skills/pinelabs-best-practices/references/refunds.md`.\n"
