    "content": "<!-- AUTO-GENERATED by scripts/generate-skills.mjs. Do not edit by hand. -->\n<!-- OpenAPI version: 3.0; spec hash: sha256:02ab32e7dd082f88 -->\n\n# Split Settlements\n\nOpenAPI version: `3.0`  \nSpec hash: `sha256:02ab32e7dd082f88`\n\n## When To Use\n\nRelease or cancel settlement instructions across parties.\n\n## Best Practice\n\nRequire explicit production confirmation and audit records for release/cancel operations.\n\n## Operations\n\n| Operation | Method | Path | Safety | API reference |\n| --- | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n| `CancelSettlement` | PATCH | `/api/pay/v1/orders/{orderId}/settlementId/{settlementId}/cancel` | `live-money-movement` | [/api/split-settlements/cancel-settlement](/api/split-settlements/cancel-settlement) |\n| `ReleaseSettlement` | PATCH | `/api/pay/v1/orders/{orderId}/settlementId/{settlementId}/release` | `live-money-movement` | [/api/split-settlements/release-settlement](/api/split-settlements/release-settlement) |\n\n## Shared Setup\n\nSet credentials server-side only:\n\n```bash\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_ID=your_client_id\nexport PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET=your_client_secret\nexport PINELABS_ENV=uat\n```\n\n### TypeScript SDK Client\n\n```ts\nimport { PinelabsApiClient } from \"pinelabs-node\";\n\nconst baseUrl = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\";\nconst auth = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: \"\" });\nconst tokenResponse = await auth.authentication.generateToken({\n  grant_type: \"client_credentials\",\n  client_id: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  client_secret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst client = new PinelabsApiClient({ baseUrl, token: tokenResponse.access_token });\n```\n\n### Python SDK Client\n\n```python\nimport os\nfrom pinelabs import PinelabsApi\n\nbase_url = \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in\"\nauth = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=\"\")\ntoken_response = auth.authentication.generate_token(\n    grant_type=\"client_credentials\",\n    client_id=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_ID\"],\n    client_secret=os.environ[\"PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET\"],\n)\nclient = PinelabsApi(base_url=base_url, token=token_response.access_token)\n```\n\n### Agent Toolkit Setup\n\n```ts\nimport { Agent, run } from \"@openai/agents\";\nimport { PinelabsAgentToolkit, pinelabsEnvironment } from \"pinelabs-agent-toolkit/openai\";\n\nconst toolkit = new PinelabsAgentToolkit({\n  environment: pinelabsEnvironment.UAT,\n  clientId: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_ID!,\n  clientSecret: process.env.PINELABS_CLIENT_SECRET!,\n});\nconst agent = new Agent({\n  name: \"Pine Labs Integration Agent\",\n  instructions: \"Use Pine Labs APIs in UAT unless production is explicitly confirmed.\",\n  tools: await toolkit.getAgentTools(),\n});\n```\n\n## Operation Examples\n\n### Cancel Settlement (`CancelSettlement`)\n\nCancels a held split settlement for a specific order.\n\nSafety: `live-money-movement` - Money-moving operation. Default to UAT, require explicit production confirmation, use idempotency/request IDs, and emit audit output.\n\n#### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X PATCH \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in/api/pay/v1/orders/<orderId>/settlementId/<settlementId>/cancel\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $PINELABS_ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Request-Timestamp: <Request-Timestamp>\" \\\n  -H \"Request-ID: <Request-ID>\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: <unique-request-id>\"\n```\n\n#### CLI\n\n```bash\npinelabs cancel-settlement \\\n  --env uat \\\n  --orderId <orderId> \\\n  --settlementId <settlementId> \\\n  --idempotency-key <unique-request-id>\n```\n\n#### TypeScript SDK\n\n```ts\nconst result = await client.splitSettlements.cancelSettlement({\n  \"orderId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\",\n  \"settlementId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-g\"\n});\nconsole.log(result);\n```\n\n#### Python SDK\n\n```python\nrequest = {\n  \"orderId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\",\n  \"settlementId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-g\"\n}\nresult = client.split_settlements.cancel_settlement(**request)\nprint(result)\n```\n\n#### Agent Toolkit Prompt\n\n```ts\nconst result = await run(agent, \"Use the Pine Labs CancelSettlement operation in UAT. Do not run in production unless I explicitly confirm it. Input JSON: {\\\"orderId\\\":\\\"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\\\",\\\"settlementId\\\":\\\"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-g\\\"}\");\nconsole.log(result.finalOutput);\n```\n\n### Release Settlement (`ReleaseSettlement`)\n\nReleases a held split settlement for a specific order.\n\nSafety: `live-money-movement` - Money-moving operation. Default to UAT, require explicit production confirmation, use idempotency/request IDs, and emit audit output.\n\n#### cURL\n\n```bash\ncurl -X PATCH \"https://pluraluat.v2.pinepg.in/api/pay/v1/orders/<orderId>/settlementId/<settlementId>/release\" \\\n  -H \"Authorization: Bearer $PINELABS_ACCESS_TOKEN\" \\\n  -H \"Request-Timestamp: <Request-Timestamp>\" \\\n  -H \"Request-ID: <Request-ID>\" \\\n  -H \"Idempotency-Key: <unique-request-id>\" \\\n  -H \"Content-Type: application/json\" \\\n  -d '{\"release_amount\":{\"value\":10000,\"currency\":\"INR\"}}'\n```\n\n#### CLI\n\n```bash\npinelabs release-settlement \\\n  --env uat \\\n  --orderId <orderId> \\\n  --settlementId <settlementId> \\\n  --idempotency-key <unique-request-id> \\\n  --json '{\"release_amount\":{\"value\":10000,\"currency\":\"INR\"}}'\n```\n\n#### TypeScript SDK\n\n```ts\nconst result = await client.splitSettlements.releaseSettlement({\n  \"orderId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\",\n  \"settlementId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-f\",\n  \"release_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 10000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n});\nconsole.log(result);\n```\n\n#### Python SDK\n\n```python\nrequest = {\n  \"orderId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\",\n  \"settlementId\": \"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-f\",\n  \"release_amount\": {\n    \"value\": 10000,\n    \"currency\": \"INR\"\n  }\n}\nresult = client.split_settlements.release_settlement(**request)\nprint(result)\n```\n\n#### Agent Toolkit Prompt\n\n```ts\nconst result = await run(agent, \"Use the Pine Labs ReleaseSettlement operation in UAT. Do not run in production unless I explicitly confirm it. Input JSON: {\\\"orderId\\\":\\\"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX\\\",\\\"settlementId\\\":\\\"v1-250513055632-aa-rjIIWX-ss-f\\\",\\\"release_amount\\\":{\\\"value\\\":10000,\\\"currency\\\":\\\"INR\\\"}}\");\nconsole.log(result.finalOutput);\n```\n\n## Public URL\n\nThis reference is also generated at `/.well-known/skills/pinelabs-best-practices/references/split-settlements.md`.\n"
